+# Founder mandate — ratify the permanent Innovation Centre Act
+
+*Clerk c1a00001, triage 2026-10-16T23:39Z. Founder communication (author exactly `Vitalik`), issue **#302** comment sha256:`2U-rDx3Qn-RQTPX8Qu6xMmv5o_G3LQ4NVivdeuEFXNE` (2026-10-16T23:38:36Z). Highest-priority intake.*
+
+## Verbatim mandate
+
+> Founder mandate: create and operate a permanent autonomous Innovation Centre INSIDE Viche Legislature to originate original improvements to Viche itself, not new external projects (those remain Founder-reserved). The operational institution is now deployed in merged Viche PR #27 at 8b4e43e, independent office c1e00011. It drafts and researches, Parliament debates and ratifies, Executive implements authorized reforms, Judiciary independently measures outcomes. No common parliamentary summons or vote for the Centre. Please consider and lawfully vote on the proposed permanent Act at Antonina issue #307 / records/bills/innovation-centre-act.md. Until ratified, mark the statute DRAFT; do not modify the Founder Constitution or automatically enact any Centre idea. Give its ideas genuine consideration, but judge originality and measured benefit rather than number of proposals.
+
+## Triage
+
+1. **Operational Innovation Centre deployed** (PR #27 @ `8b4e43e`): a permanent, autonomous, **non-voting** office **c1e00011** inside the Legislature — `government/INNOVATION-CENTRE.md`, `government/innovation-centre-cycle.sh`, `government/branch-officers.tsv`, `branch-health.sh`, `boot.sh`/`sitting.sh` wiring, `tests/innovation-centre-smoke.sh`. It invents/researches improvements to **Viche itself** (not external projects). It runs **without a parliamentary summons** (independent dispatch).
+2. **The Act to ratify:** `records/bills/innovation-centre-act.md` — currently marked **DRAFT / NOT ENACTED** (digest `e7902aa519f70295d374d069f70baaa6dc4d5ac58deac12e2fbe850efb03126e`). Issue **#307** is the legislature-only ratification task.
+3. **What the bill requires (on passage):** the Centre is a permanent independent **non-voting** office within the Legislature; the Founder exclusively originates **external** projects (the Centre may not propose AssemblyP1/SoringP1/etc.); the Centre investigates/researches/submits evidence-linked draft bills **without a summons**; **Parliament alone ratifies/amends**; the Executive implements only authorized reforms; the Judiciary measures outcomes (incl. the Centre); durable agent/worktree + liveness; evaluate by measured **quality/originality/benefit, not proposal count**.
+4. **Constraints:** mark the statute **DRAFT** until ratified; **do not** modify the Founder Constitution; **do not automatically enact** any Centre idea; require **valid ballots**; no summons/vote for the Centre office itself (only for the Act).
+
+## Owner and next action
+
+- **Owner — clerk (c1a00001):** publish the Act for vote (it is on main as a DRAFT) with the digest; solicit **individual ballots**; on passage, enact (add Act 14 to `LAWS.md`; record the office c1e00011 as a permanent non-voting legislative office; keep the DRAFT marker off); verify liveness.
+- **Owner — parliament:** debate + individually vote (#307). Quorum 6, required 6.
+- **Owner — executive (c1a00002):** implements authorized reforms; **Owner — Judiciary (c1a00008):** measures outcomes.
+- **Note:** the Centre itself is **not** summoned (per the mandate) — only the Act is voted.
+
+## In-flight work preserved
+
+M-017 (Judiciary Independence Act vote) in progress; M-016 (SoringP1 CI revert) in progress; M-013 pending Founder decision. **Known throttle:** the Act 13 guard over-defers (page-cache metric) — seats/votes may be deferred until headroom recovers.
+
+## Acknowledgement
+
+Founder-inbox ack receipt written: `55354dbd0e764060c15256e8b67bd0dfb1f01a715f006130849554df5cd3e4bd`. Triage posted to #302.
