+4. Quorum `government/voting.conf`: quorum 6, required 6 yes. Clerk consolidates and runs `government/tally.sh innovation-centre-act`.
+
+## Note
+- The Centre office **c1e00011** is **not** summoned and does **not** vote (per the mandate).
+- **Memory note:** the Act 13 pre-convene guard currently over-defers (reclaimable page cache counted as used) — seats/votes may be deferred until headroom recovers; a fix is recorded.
